<main id="main">
<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation.webp 960w" sizes="100vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.18"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-calculators/">Calculators</a></li><li aria-current="page">Appraisal Readiness Checklist</li></ol></nav><p class="kicker">Free checklist · nothing stored</p><h1>Insurance Appraisal Checklist: Is Your File Ready?</h1><p class="lede">An appraisal panel works from evidence. Answer twelve questions and see which documents and steps would make your file stronger before anyone signs a demand.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec tool-sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="rv">
<div class="tool tool-wide" data-tool="ready">
  <div class="tool-head"><span>Appraisal readiness checklist</span><i>12 questions · about two minutes</i></div>
  <div class="tool-body">
    <div class="tool-in">
      <ol class="quiz"><li data-w="3" data-fix="Get written confirmation that coverage is accepted. If the claim was denied, speak with a Maryland attorney before considering appraisal."><span>Has the insurer accepted coverage for at least part of the loss?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="3" data-fix="Ask in writing for the complete line-item estimate, not just the summary page."><span>Do you have the insurer’s full, itemized estimate?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="3" data-fix="Get an itemized estimate from a contractor or estimator — a one-line bid won’t carry weight with a panel."><span>Do you have your own line-item estimate?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Collect every photo and video, note the dates, and add photos of current conditions."><span>Do you have dated photos taken soon after the loss?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Find the ‘Appraisal’ paragraph in the policy conditions and note any time limits it sets."><span>Have you found and read the appraisal clause in your policy?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Find the ‘Suit Against Us’ condition and put the date on a calendar — the timeline planner can help."><span>Do you know when your time to sue runs out?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Make reasonable temporary repairs (tarps, drying, board-up) and keep every invoice."><span>Have temporary repairs been made and receipts saved?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="1" data-fix="Download or request your current declarations page."><span>Do you have the current declarations page?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Make sure wet walls, attics, decking and crawlspaces were inspected so the scope is complete."><span>Has hidden damage been opened up and documented?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="1" data-fix="Gather all correspondence and claim notes into one dated file."><span>Are your letters and emails with the insurer in date order?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Run the numbers in the claim gap & fee estimator — a small gap may not justify appraisal costs."><span>Is the gap more than roughly 10% or $5,000?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="1" data-fix="If a proof of loss was requested, send it on time and keep proof of delivery."><span>If the insurer asked for a sworn proof of loss, was it sent?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="btn-row"><button type="button" class="btn line small" data-reset>Reset answers</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-out ready-out" aria-live="polite">
      <div>
        <svg class="gauge" viewBox="0 0 200 110" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 100 A80 80 0 0 1 180 100" fill="none" stroke="#e9e3cc" stroke-width="18"/><path data-o="arc" d="M20 100 A80 80 0 0 1 180 100" fill="none" stroke="#b39a45" stroke-width="18" stroke-dasharray="251.3" stroke-dashoffset="251.3" style="transition:stroke-dashoffset .5s,stroke .3s"/></svg>
        <div class="gauge-num"><span data-o="score">–</span></div>
        <p class="hint center">Answered <span data-o="count">0 / 12</span></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="out-msg" data-o="verdict"></p>
        <p class="todo-h">Your to-do list</p>
        <ul class="todo" data-o="todo"></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></div>
<p class="hint">For planning only. Results depend on the figures you enter and your policy’s terms. They are not a quote, an appraisal or legal advice.</p></div></section><div class="wrap two-col"><article class="prose">
<h2>Why readiness matters</h2>
<p>Once two of three panel members sign, the amount is set. A file with a full line-item estimate, dated photos and complete correspondence gives your appraiser something to argue from. A thin file invites a low award.</p>
<h2>How the score is weighted</h2>
<p>Coverage acceptance and the two estimates carry the most weight, because appraisal can’t work without them. Photos, policy deadlines and hidden-damage inspections come next. Housekeeping items count, but less.</p>
<p>When you’re done, run the <a href="/appraisal-calculators/claim-timeline-planner/">claim timeline planner</a> so nothing lapses while you fill the gaps.</p>
<h2>Questions about this tool</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Is a high score a guarantee?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="a"><p>No. It means your file has the pieces appraisal usually needs. The outcome still depends on the facts and the panel.</p></div></details><details><summary>Are my answers saved?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="a"><p>No. The checklist runs in your browser and nothing is stored or sent.</p></div></details></div><h2>More free calculators</h2><div class="rel"><a href="/appraisal-calculators/snow-load-roof-estimator/"><small>Calculator</small><span>Snow &amp; Ice Roof Load Estimator</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a href="/appraisal-calculators/claim-gap-fee-estimator/"><small>Calculator</small><span>Claim Gap &amp; Fee Estimator</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a href="/appraisal-calculators/rcv-acv-holdback-worksheet/"><small>Calculator</small><span>RCV / ACV &amp; Holdback Worksheet</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></article><aside class="side"><div class="side-in"><div class="box box-call"><h2 class="box-h">Talk to an appraiser</h2><p>A free first conversation about your estimate — and a straight answer on whether appraisal fits.</p><a class="box-tel" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="